      "'Check the proposed change.'",
      "'Corner lifecycle: build, check, get a yes, merge, or close'",
      "'NFKD'",
      "'SELECT pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtext($1))'",
      "'Set up the corner for the agreed work.'",
      "'The change has landed.'",
      "'The corner has closed.'",
      "'Use your passkey for'",
